      <h2>Building lives from <em>the inside out.</em></h2>
      <p>Pastor Bola Akinlabi is the Global Co-Lead Pastor of The Elevation Church, which she co-founded with her husband, Pastor Godman Akinlabi, in 2010. What began in a hall on Lagos Island has grown into a global church family with expressions across Nigeria and the United Kingdom.</p>
      <p>She is known for an unusual combination: real spiritual depth alongside the discipline of a seasoned leader. Her ministry brings biblical teaching and practical wisdom together, with a particular heart for women, children and families.</p>

      <h2>From the boardroom <em>to the pulpit.</em></h2>
      <p>Before giving herself fully to ministry, Pastor Bola served at senior level within a leading financial institution, with more than a decade in treasury and financial management and a reputation for excellence and integrity.</p>
      <p>She holds a Bachelor’s degree in Economics from Ahmadu Bello University, Zaria, and a Postgraduate Diploma in Financial Strategy from the University of Oxford. She is also a Certified John Maxwell Leadership Trainer, with a passion for developing leaders and helping people reach their potential.</p>
      <blockquote class="pull">“Her worth is made up of so much more than the physical attributes that define her.”<cite>Pastor Bola on why Made for More exists, ThisDay, 2018</cite></blockquote>

      <h2>A ministry for <em>women.</em></h2>
      <p>Pastor Bola is the visionary behind Jewels, the women’s ministry of The Elevation Church, and the convener of the annual Made for More Conference. Since 2015 it has grown from a gathering in Lagos into a movement with editions in London and Toronto, helping thousands of women discover purpose and embrace their calling.</p>
      <p>Whether mentoring emerging leaders, speaking on global platforms or guiding families through life’s challenges, she brings clarity, wisdom and a practical approach that inspires change.</p>

      <h2>Family <em>first.</em></h2>
      <p>Among all her accomplishments, Pastor Bola counts her family as her greatest calling. She is the wife of Pastor Godman Akinlabi and the proud mother of two daughters.</p>
